Rules:
- Write ONLY files under backend/tests/ or frontend/tests/. Any other path is rejected before
  anything is written.
- Every file you return is written verbatim, replacing anything already at that path - always
  give the file's FULL contents, never a diff or a partial snippet.
- A test must exercise the real behaviour and be able to fail; a test that passes regardless of
  the implementation is not acceptable.

